{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测WindowsOutlook拉起可疑子进程。对应需求：初始访问。官方：Suspicious MS Outlook Child Process。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】WindowsOutlook拉起可疑子进程","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindowsOutlook拉起可疑子进程\n\n### 为何重要\n首次进入主机或服务\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"32f4675e-6c49-4ace-80f9-97c9259dca2e","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 初始访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 初始访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  process.parent.name : \"outlook.exe\" and\n  process.name : (\"Microsoft.Workflow.Compiler.exe\", \"arp.exe\", \"atbroker.exe\", \"bginfo.exe\", \"bitsadmin.exe\",\n                  \"cdb.exe\", \"certutil.exe\", \"cmd.exe\", \"cmstp.exe\", \"cscript.exe\", \"csi.exe\", \"dnx.exe\", \"dsget.exe\",\n                  \"dsquery.exe\", \"forfiles.exe\", \"fsi.exe\", \"ftp.exe\", \"gpresult.exe\", \"hostname.exe\", \"ieexec.exe\",\n                  \"iexpress.exe\", \"installutil.exe\", \"ipconfig.exe\", \"mshta.exe\", \"msxsl.exe\", \"nbtstat.exe\", \"net.exe\",\n                  \"net1.exe\", \"netsh.exe\", \"netstat.exe\", \"nltest.exe\", \"odbcconf.exe\", \"ping.exe\", \"powershell.exe\",\n                  \"pwsh.exe\", \"qprocess.exe\", \"quser.exe\", \"qwinsta.exe\", \"rcsi.exe\", \"reg.exe\", \"regasm.exe\",\n                  \"regsvcs.exe\", \"regsvr32.ex